  "prefLabel": "Plc 904.01 Qualifications for Initial Licensure as a Massage Therapist",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 904.01 Qualifications for Initial Licensure as a Massage Therapist. To qualify for initial licensure as a massage therapist, an individual shall:\n\n(a) Meet the educational requirements described in Plc 904.02; and\n\n(b) Pass one of the examinations identified in Plc 904.05.\n\nSource. #14387, eff 10-17-25, EXPIRES: 10-17-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc900.html"
